  "result": "Excellent! The **dashboard implementation is complete and all 396 tests pass**.\n\n**Dashboard Function (src/reports.js):**\n\nReturns `{ counts, outstanding, overdue, topCustomers }`:\n\n1. **counts**: Number of invoices per status\n   - draft, issued, partially_paid, paid\n   \n2. **outstanding**: Total still due\n   - Only on invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid'\n   - Calculated using `balanceDue()`\n\n3. **overdue**: { count, amount }\n   - Count: number of overdue invoices\n   - Amount: total due on overdue invoices\n   - Uses existing `overdueInvoices()` function\n\n4. **topCustomers**: Top 3 customers with most due\n   - Array of [{ customerId, due }]\n   - Sorted by due amount (highest first)\n   - Aggregates multiple invoices per customer\n   - Only includes issued/partially_paid invoices\n\n**Tests Added (12 new tests):**\n- Empty invoice handling\n- Status count verification\n- Outstanding calculation (including/excluding statuses)\n- Overdue count and amount\n- Top 3 customers selection and sorting\n- Multiple invoices per customer aggregation\n- Fewer than 3 customers handling\n- Data structure validation\n\nAll 396 tests passing (384 original + 12 new).",
